  "transport_observation": {
    "unchanged_h3082_fc06": "No response after one retry during the export trial. H3082 was read back as 0 before and after; no retry or cleanup write was issued.",
    "interpretation": "The planner/executor should omit unchanged logical segments and should not write H3082 merely because it belongs to the logical image. The timeout is retained as a transport observation, not classified as a device semantic failure."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "The tests were supervised, short smoke tests and did not establish persistence across reboot or behavior on other firmware.",
    "The charge trial occurred with substantial PV input, so a no-PV night test is still needed for an isolated grid-charge claim.",
    "No cleanup or disable write was issued after either test to avoid unnecessary flash writes; future plans may overwrite the test slots.",
    "Raw local logs and Recorder database are not redistributed; this artifact contains a bounded extract only."
